n Intoxication</article-title><source>Mar Drugs</source><year>2008</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>220</fpage><lpage>242</lpage>doi:10.3390/md6020220.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18728726</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b9-marinedrugs-07-00019"><label>9.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ramsdell</surname><given-names>JS</given-names></name><name><surname>Zabka</surname><given-names>TS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title><italic>In Utero</italic> Domoic Acid Toxicity: A Fetal Basis to Adult Disease in the California Sea Lion (Zalophus californianus)</article-title><source>Mar. Drugs</source><year>2008</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>262</fpage><lpage>290</lpage>doi:10.3390/md6020262.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18728728</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b10-marinedrugs-07-00019"><label>10.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Deeds</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></name><name><surname>Landsberg</surname><given-names>JH</given-names></name><name><surname>Etheridge</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name><name><surname>Pitcher</surname><given-names>GC</given-names></name><name><surname>Longan</surname><given-names>SW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Non-Traditional Vectors for Paralytic Shellfish Poisoning</article-title><source>Mar Drugs</source><year>2008</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>308</fpage><lpage>348</lpage>doi:10.3390/md6020308.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18728730</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b11-marinedrugs-07-00019"><label>11.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Neurotoxins from Marine Dinoflagellates: A Brief Review</article-title><source>Mar Drugs</source><year>2008</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>349</fpage><lpage>371</lpage>doi:10.3390/md6020349.<pub-id 